<title>ITALY: Pirelli&amp;C net profit down, plans buyback.</title>
<headline>Pirelli&amp;C net profit down, plans buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			77.7   vs   84</p>
<p>    Net attributable		     79.9   vs   87.5</p>
<p>    Gross operating profit	     92.6   vs   75.1</p>
<p>    Ord dividend			 100 lire vs  80 lire</p>
<p>    Savings dividend		   120 lire vs 100 lire</p>
<p>Note - Pirelli &amp; C holds a 52.59 percent stake in the cable and tyremaker Pirelli Spa.</p>
<p>Pirelli &amp; C said it proposed a share buyback for up to 50 billion lire to be made within 18 months.</p>
</text>
